<title>SPAIN: Spain's Repsol increases Algas stake.</title>
<headline>Spain's Repsol increases Algas stake.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish energy group Repsol, via unit Astra, has increased its stake in liquefied petroleum gas marketer Algas to 99.3 percent from 95.4 percent, Repsol said in a statement on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Repsol's stake in Poligas Eujan S.A., a subsidiary of Algas, increased to 98.4 percent.</p>
<p>Algas and Poligas have an estimated 13 percent market share of liquefied petroleum gas in Argentina.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585-2160</p>
</text>
